  - edge-ai
  - embedded-ai
  - computer-vision
  - NPU
  - robotics

abstract: >-
  AetherSign is an edge Chinese sign-language recognition system designed
  for high-dynamic robotic interaction scenarios. The system follows a
  Sign-to-Skeleton-to-Gloss pipeline and performs palm detection, hand
  landmark estimation, and isolated sign classification on an
  ultra-low-compute embedded NPU platform.